<title>CROATIA: Croatian November RPI 0.5 mo/mo, 3.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatian November RPI 0.5 mo/mo, 3.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES	 NOVEMBER    OCTOBER    NOV '95</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	    +0.5	 +0.6	  +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year			+3.5	 +3.2	  +3.7</p>
<p>NOTE -- Retail prices rose 3.6 percent between January and November compared to a year-ago period.</p>
<p>Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly inflation hit 38.7 percent. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
